__pycache__/
*.pyc
cache/
# Everything in data/ is regenerable except id_anchors.json — see the
# root .gitignore for why this is `data/*` and not `data/`.
data/*
!data/id_anchors.json
# Small and human-measured, so they belong with id_anchors.json rather
# than with the 30 MB AdE downloads they happen to sit beside. NOTE this
# file is the one that actually governs data/ — the root .gitignore's
# rules are overridden here, and editing only the root looks like it
# works until you run `git check-ignore -v`.
!data/surface_reads.md
!data/surface_sample.md
!data/*.json
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
phase0_results.csv
# normalize.py output. Regenerable in seconds from the database and the
# deflator table, and byte-identical across runs, so committing it would
# only add diff noise on every ingest.
normalized.csv
comune_bands.json
